{"3656370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buried", "steam_appid": 3656370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENGEANCE AND INTROSPECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast paced Boomer Shooter you take the role of an escaped super soldier as she embarks on a journey of self discovery and revenge. Slice, shoot and dodge your way through until no evil is left standing and you've finally got your answers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/77d2f6197f643059db4e19cd84928ada.poster.avif?t=1788132970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/77d2f6197f643059db4e19cd84928ada.webm?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/77d2f6197f643059db4e19cd84928ada.mp4?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DAMNED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange looking version of our world, one that is full of destruction and ruin, remnants of past wars and apocalyptic events, is covered in oceans of blood and has a number of humanoid abominations roaming it's wastelands. The world's last city is being oversaw by a totalitarian extremist organization, thus, in this world, the safest place is under the command of absolute evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3046600ed7cde252d24f22b52ad3f0ff.poster.avif?t=1788132970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3046600ed7cde252d24f22b52ad3f0ff.webm?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3046600ed7cde252d24f22b52ad3f0ff.mp4?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR BRAIN IS YOUR ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain is extremely confused and deranged because of the 20 years of constant information being pumped into it, it sometimes misleads you and presents you with nightmarish visions of your actions and deepest desires. Along your journey you will often find yourself witness to horrors beyond your comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.poster.avif?t=1788132970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.webm?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.mp4?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAVE YOU GOT WHAT IT TAKES TO FIGHT FOR YOUR PEACE AND HAPINESS?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENGEANCE AND INTROSPECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast paced Boomer Shooter you take the role of an escaped super soldier as she embarks on a journey of self discovery and revenge. Slice, shoot and dodge your way through until no evil is left standing and you've finally got your answers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com