sion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.poster.avif?t=1788132970\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.webm?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/extras/3d719eeb57c82276bd57fb8f15c69cac.mp4?t=1788132970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAVE YOU GOT WHAT IT TAKES TO FIGHT FOR YOUR PEACE AND HAPINESS?</h2>", "short_description": "An abandoned super soldier wakes up after 20 years of being trained while sedated. Because of her abandonment she managed to develop free will and she sets out on a journey to wreck destruction upon the masterminds behind her upbringing.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/f6498fdc494198550a7cea4f000b8d14ef056cff/header.jpg?t=1788132970", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/8e45efd560d04463369ad3712fce439b2599f10d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788132970", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656370/8e45efd560d04463369ad3712fce439b2599f10d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788132970", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 128 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stron